 "title": "一次初始化",
 "pill": 1,
 "total": 62.44,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2022 年 8 月 1 日，跨链桥 Nomad 被提走约 1.9 亿美元，按事发时估值。",
   "spoken": "2022 年 8 月 1 日，跨链桥 Nomad 被提走约 1.9 亿美元，按事发时估值。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg1-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 7.2,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 8.627
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "起因，是此前的一次升级。",
   "spoken": "起因，是此前的一次升级。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg1-01.wav",
   "start": 9.02,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 9.111,
   "speechEnd": 11.211
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "这次升级调用了初始化函数，把可信的消息根，设成了全零。",
   "spoken": "这次升级掉用了初始化函数，把可信的消息根，设成了全零。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg1-02.wav",
   "start": 11.64,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 11.735,
   "speechEnd": 16.833
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "桥合约收到一条消息，先查它对应的根，再看这个根是否可信。",
   "spoken": "桥合约收到一条消息，先查它对应的根，再看这个根是否可信。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg1-03.wav",
   "start": 17.22,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 17.31,
   "speechEnd": 22.325
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg1-04.wav",
   "start": 22.72,
   "dur": 1.04,
   "speechStart": 22.72,
   "speechEnd": 23.521
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "一条从没被证明过的消息，查到的根是什么？它能通过吗？",
   "spoken": "一条从没被证明过的消息，查到的根是什么？它能通过吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg1-05.wav",
   "start": 23.98,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 23.98,
   "speechEnd": 29.458
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "它查到的是默认值，全零。",
   "spoken": "它查到的是默认值，全零。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg1-06.wav",
   "start": 30.16,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speechStart": 30.253,
   "speechEnd": 32.936
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "而全零，刚刚被这次升级，标记成了可信。",
   "spoken": "而全零，刚刚被这次升级，标记成了可信。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg1-07.wav",
   "start": 33.42,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 33.514,
   "speechEnd": 36.937
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "所以，任何消息都被视为已经证明。",
   "spoken": "所以，任何消息都被视为已经证明。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg1-08.wav",
   "start": 37.4,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 37.4,
   "speechEnd": 40.595
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "按 Immunefi 的复盘和 The Block 的报道，第一笔提款成功后，数百个地址复制了这笔交易，只换掉收款地址。",
   "spoken": "按 Immunefi 的复盘和 The Block 的报道，第一笔提款成功后，数百个地址复制了这笔交易，只换掉收款地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg1-09.wav",
   "start": 40.98,
   "dur": 8.88,
   "speechStart": 40.98,
   "speechEnd": 49.649
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "升级的代码，可以没有错。",
   "spoken": "升级的代码，可以没有错。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg1-10.wav",
   "start": 50.08,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 50.08,
   "speechEnd": 52.984
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-11",
   "text": "错的，是升级时传进去的参数。",
   "spoken": "错的，是升级时传进去的参数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg1-11.wav",
   "start": 53.42,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 53.51,
   "speechEnd": 56.004
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-12",
   "text": "能升级的合约，是怎么搭起来的？谁能换掉它的代码？",
